BT /F2 14 Tf 0.16 0.2 0.3 rg 40 588 Td (I. Laying Plans) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.25 0.29 0.38 rg 40 538 Td (The art of war is of vital importance to the State. It is a matter of life and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.25 0.29 0.38 rg 40 520 Td (death, a road either to safety or to ruin. Hence it is a subject of inquiry) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.25 0.29 0.38 rg 40 502 Td (which can on no account be neglected. The art of war is governed by five) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.25 0.29 0.38 rg 40 484 Td (constant factors: the Moral Law, Heaven, Earth, the Commander, and Method and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.25 0.29 0.38 rg 40 466 Td (Discipline. All warfare is based on deception. Hence, when able to attack, we) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.25 0.29 0.38 rg 40 448 Td (must seem unable; when using our forces, we must seem inactive.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.6 0.6 0.6 rg 206 36 Td (2) Tj ET
endstream
